  "description": "The server's review of a pushed void (sync spec §6.2, D-011, D-059, W1-12): findings, never a refusal. Each case changes the base void (void.test.ts: C03-V000001, the salesman …a1 voids C03-S000412 with the manager …a2's PIN at 09:20 UTC on 2026-11-03, the desk pending) and gives what the server holds: the bill (null until it arrives), a handover in of that bill number (null when none; it may be an offline scan whose bill hasn't arrived), and an earlier void of the bill (null when none). The approver is judged on the roles the server holds now (testing/counter.ts). Findings in order: duplicate_void (alone: a second void is never posted), void_not_permitted (cause not_permitted, window_none or other_day: the bill's business date, or the document's when the bill hasn't arrived), cash_received_for_void (the cash is in the drawer for a voided bill, D-059; order: whether the handover was made before or after the void). W1-23 (D-111): a V2 void whose paymentChecks say any money had arrived is void_not_permitted (money_arrived); cash_received_for_void says how the counter knew the cash wasn't at the desk (cashKnown: checked, asked, or null for V1).",
